   "source": [
    "# Data Cleaning & Preparation\n",
    "\n",
    "Before conducting any analysis, the datasets were carefully cleaned and prepared to ensure reliable and meaningful results.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Match Results Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "The **results.csv** dataset contains **49,520 international matches** played between **1872 and 2026**.\n",
    "\n",
    "During the initial inspection, two matches from the **2026 FIFA World Cup** were found with missing score values (the Third-Place Playoff and the Final). Since these official results are publicly available, the missing values were manually verified and completed instead of removing the records.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Feature Engineering\n",
    "\n",
    "To support temporal analysis, the following features were created:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Converted the `date` column to the datetime format.\n",
    "- Extracted the `year` of each match.\n",
    "- Created a `decade` feature for long-term trend analysis.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Team Name Standardization\n",
    "\n",
    "A detailed inspection revealed **337 unique team names**, which is considerably higher than FIFA's **211 official member associations**.\n",
    "\n",
    "This discrepancy is mainly caused by:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Historical countries (e.g., Yugoslavia, Czechoslovakia)\n",
    "- Non-FIFA representative teams\n",
    "- Regional selections and territories\n",
    "- Island Games participants\n",
    "- Unrecognized or disputed national entities\n",
    "\n",
    "Since these teams are not directly comparable to FIFA national teams, a curated exclusion list was created for analyses involving national team performance.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Goalscorers Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "The **goalscorers.csv** dataset required additional preprocessing:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Removed **936 own goals**, as they should not contribute to a player's scoring record.\n",
    "- Removed **44 records with missing scorer names**, all originating from an under-documented tournament in 1980."
   ]
  },
