    "## Feature Engineering\n",
    "\n",
    "To enrich the dataset and support deeper analysis, several new features are created from the existing match information.\n",
    "\n",
    "These engineered features capture different aspects of each match, including:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Year** and **decade** for long-term historical analysis.\n",
    "- **Total goals** scored in each match.\n",
    "- **Goal margin**, which measures how competitive or one-sided a match was.\n",
    "- **Match outcome** from the home team's perspective (home win, away win, or draw).\n",
    "\n",
    "These features will be used throughout the exploratory data analysis to uncover trends in international football performance."
