    "## Transforming Match Data to Team-Level Records\n",
    "\n",
    "The original dataset stores each match as a single record containing both the home and away teams.\n",
    "\n",
    "However, many analyses focus on the performance of individual national teams rather than matches themselves. To facilitate this, we transform the dataset into a **team-centric format**, where each match contributes **two records**:\n",
