    "## Team Efficiency Ranking (FIFA Members Only)\n",
    "\n",
    "After filtering out historical and non-FIFA entities, we recalculate the efficiency metrics using only official FIFA national teams.\n",
    "\n",
    "Each team is evaluated based on:\n",
