    "## Detecting Extreme Matches Using Z-score\n",
    "\n",
    "To identify statistically unusual results, we calculate the Z-score of the goal margin.\n",
    "\n",
    "A match is considered an extreme outlier when its goal margin is more than **3 standard deviations** above the average."
